        {
          "text": "Ngooyu mulao ngwabikide Jehova, ngwalailide. Wati, Ambila bana ba-Israyeli kuti bakuletele impwizi iisalala imbotu iitakwe kampenda, iitana kubopwa ijokwe. ",
