        },
        {
          "text": "Amane kucita obo, mupaizi asanzye zyakusama zyakwe akusamba amubili. Amana kusamba, anjile mumalabba, lino mupaizi ulasofwaala mane kusikila kumabbililo aazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
