        {
          "text": "Uleelede kulisalazya mubuzuba bwatatu amubuzuba bwamusanu aabili, kuti asupuke, Na wabula kulisalazya mubuzuba bwatatu amubuzuba bwamusanu aabili, tasupuki pe. ",
