        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa muntu uuguma mutunta wamuntu naba omwe uufwide, pele talisalazyi, oyo muntu wasofwaazya cikombelo ca-Jehova, lino oyo muntu ulatandwa kuzwa kuba-Israyeli. Takakasansailwa maanzi aakusalazya busofwi, aboobo ulisofweede; busofwi bwakwe mobucili mulinguwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.13",
