        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu uusalala asansaile muntu uusofweede mubuzuba bwatatu amubuzuba bwamusanu aabili. Lino mubuzuba bwamusanu aabili alisalazye, asanzye zyakusama zyakwe, asambe amubili, nkabela kumabbililo aazuba ulasalala.",
