        {
          "text": "Pele muntu uusofweede uutalisalazyi, oyo muntu ulatandwa kumbungano, nkaambo wasofwaazya cikombelo ca-Jehova; nkaambo takwakasansailwa maanzi aakusalazya busofwi, aboobo ulisofweede, ",
