              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyooba mulao walyoonse kulimbabo. Kufumbwa muntu uusansaila maanzi aakusalazya busofwi uleelede kusanzya zyakusama zyakwe; ayooyo uuguma maanzi aakusalazya busofwi ulasofwaala mane kusikila kumabbililo aazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
